Package: oddsapiio
Title: Client for the 'Odds-API.io' Sports Betting Odds API
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Markus", "Bjermeland", email = "markus@odds-api.io", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Query live and upcoming sports betting odds from the
    'Odds-API.io' REST API <https://docs.odds-api.io>. Covers sports,
    bookmakers, leagues, events, per-event odds, value bets and arbitrage
    bets across 265+ bookmakers, returned as tidy data frames. An API key
    is required; a free tier is available.
